#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:bf_calendar_subscribe.bf_calendar_subscription_action
msgid ""
"Paste the address a calendar publishes (Outlook, Google, Apple, Nextcloud).\n"
"               Its events appear in your calendar in their own colour, read only, and its\n"
"               busy times are no longer offered for online booking."
msgstr ""
"Collez l'adresse qu'un agenda publie (Outlook, Google, Apple, Nextcloud). "
"Ses événements paraissent dans votre agenda dans leur couleur, en lecture "
"seule, et ses heures occupées ne sont plus offertes à la prise de rendez-"
"vous."

