msgid ""
"Read only: events from this calendar are changed in that calendar, never here.\n"
"                        Their busy times close online booking slots. Only open standards are used\n"
"                        (iCalendar over https); in Outlook, publish the calendar and paste its ICS link."
msgstr ""
"En lecture seule : les événements de cet agenda se modifient dans cet "
"agenda, jamais ici. Leurs heures occupées ferment des créneaux de prise de "
"rendez-vous. Seuls des standards ouverts servent (iCalendar en https) ; dans"
" Outlook, publiez l'agenda et collez son lien ICS."

